	"notice": "Use USB-A to host a class-compliant USB MIDI device and USB-C for a computer or power. Configure routing with HxMIDI Tools. Bluetooth requires the optional WIDI Core module; it is not built in. MIDI IN receives from instrument OUT; MIDI OUT sends to instrument IN. Stored routing and filters determine which messages reach each port. This is a transport profile with no instrument note or CC map. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams are simplified connection and control schematics, not scale drawings.",
